# Unit Tests Required

Every production code change in this repo must ship with unit tests in the same unit of work / commit.

## Requirements

- Add or update Vitest tests for new/changed components, composables, utils, and public types
- Prefer colocated or `tests/` mirrors; name files `*.test.ts` / `*.spec.ts`
- Cover happy path, edge cases called out in the unit plan, and regression cases you fix
- Run `npm test` (or the unit’s targeted Vitest command) before committing; leave tests green
- Documentation-only or plan-only units may omit code tests, but must still document required test cases for later implementation units

## Do not

- Land chart/render logic, public API types, or utilities without corresponding assertions
- Skip tests because a feature is a “placeholder” — placeholders get smoke/mount or type-contract tests at minimum
- Treat Playwright/manual checks as a substitute for unit tests (they complement, not replace)
